    "id": "war-of-the-worlds-world",
    "name": "The War of the Worlds",
    "description": "H. G. Wells’s invasion novel follows ordinary witnesses through the collapse of Victorian England as technologically overwhelming Martians strike Surrey and London, testing human confidence, social order, companionship, and the fragile biological conditions of conquest.",
