      "id": "war-of-the-worlds-lore-1",
      "categoryId": "war-of-the-worlds-lore-category-martian",
      "title": "Mars and Opposition",
      "body": "At astronomical opposition, observers see eruptions interpreted later as launches toward Earth.",
