      "id": "war-of-the-worlds-lore-3",
      "categoryId": "war-of-the-worlds-lore-category-martian",
      "title": "Heat-Ray and Black Smoke",
      "body": "The invasion combines directed energy with a poisonous vapour dispersed against artillery and settlements.",
